 3. System Effectiveness
HeartAI turns raw statistical outputs into actionable, real-time insights, improving workflows in several key areas:

* Elimination of Cognitive Context-Switching: Clinicians no longer have to cross-reference data tables alongside separate static medical diagrams. HeartAI visualizes statistical predictions directly onto an interactive 3D model.
* Instantaneous Parametric Mapping: The 3D render thread handles input data changes seamlessly. Shifting a patient slider (such as elevating fasting blood sugar or oldpeak stress metrics) instantly scales and shifts color gradients on the 3D model, highlighting potential cardiovascular risks right away.
* Enhanced Patient-Physician Communication: Transforming an abstract risk factor into a clear, color-coded 3D model helps patients intuitively understand their diagnosis, leading to faster treatment decisions and higher compliance rates.
* Low Computational Footprint: By using React Three Fiber and WebGL, the 3D rendering is hardware-accelerated and runs at a smooth 60 FPS on standard web browsers without requiring expensive GPU servers.

